140	/**
141	 * The two halves have to agree.
142	 *
143	 * `closeOrphanedRuns` writes the shape, `run-lifecycle` judges it, and
144	 * `007_run_closure.sql` enforces it. If the writer produced a row its own audit
145	 * rejected, the fix would be self-contradicting -- so the row this function
